<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Coherence Measurement for Arithmetic Reasoning Using Llama-3.1, where PPL refers to Perplexity, GPTS to GPT Score, and HumanE to Human Evaluation. And LNE-Blocking is denoted as LB.</figcaption>
<div id="S6.T4.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:327.8pt;height:33.9pt;vertical-align:-15.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-132.2pt,13.7pt) scale(0.553460504923679,0.553460504923679) ;">
