</div>
<div id="lstnumberx3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space">    </span>&gt;&gt;&gt;<span id="lstnumberx3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>string_sequence(0)
