<div id="A7.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Furthermore, we provide examples in Table <a href="#A7.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix G Analysis of Blocking Tokens ‣ LNE-Blocking: An Efficient Framework for Contamination Mitigation Evaluation on Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, displaying the complete model outputs both before and after applying the Blocking operation, to demonstrate its impact on the model’s response.</p>
